DETAIL:  cannot alter relation of syssso_role/syssao_role member
alter index idx1_sao_u1_id set (fillfactor = 75);
ERROR:  permission denied
DETAIL:  cannot alter relation of syssso_role/syssao_role member
alter index idx1_u1_id set (fillfactor = 75);
ERROR:  permission denied
DETAIL:  sysdba_role member can only alter relation of itself
